# role: nephos-operator
#
# Trusted machine that provisions and deploys, but is not the secret keeper.
# Loseable: revoking its credential must not touch the keeper. Holds nothing
# long-lived, so a stolen laptop yields no standing access.

tier          operator
summary       provisions and deploys; holds no long-lived secrets
control_port  allow
ssh_command   -
holds         nothing-at-rest
service_ports *
may           provision deploy run-workloads use-credentials
may_not       revoke read-vault
